{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_01DEwx5sEQVRC41zhG2MH6He","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done — all ten SOS cards are implemented, tested, and committed. The full suite passes: **1250 tests** (1145 engine regression + 105 card tests, including 56 new SOS tests), with one commit per checklist item (13 commits).\n\n**Shared engine seams built first (E1–E3):**\n- **E1**: `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` now fires from `cast_spell` *and* `cast_spell_free` (a free cast is still a cast per rule 601.2); copies via `copy_spell` correctly don't fire it.\n- **E2**: new `BeginningOfPrecombatMainTriggeredEvent`, fired from `GameState.advance_phase` after `empty_mana_pools()`.\n- **E3**: `get_cost_reduction` aggregates `spell_cost_reduction` from the caster's battlefield permanents for instants/sorceries.\n\n**Cards:** sos_4 (Converge via `colors_spent`), sos_1 (graveyard cost reduction + attack free-cast + exile-instead replacement), sos_245 (affinity self + grant via E3), sos_226 (Casualty 1 with spell copy and new-target choice), sos_257 (land with restricted mana + in-place 2/4 Wizard animation + cast pump), sos_57 (counter + delayed `{C}` via E2), sos_120 (Paradigm: exile-on-resolve every time, recurring first-main copy after first resolution), sos_13 (ETB Inkling token, prepared per rule 722.3c), sos_201 (miracle {2} via draw trigger + opponent-upkeep loot), sos_97 (surveil/discard/reanimate/coin-flip skip-turns).\n\n**Additional minimal engine edits, each driven by a real card need** (all additive, logged in `KEY_DECISIONS.md`): firing the previously-dead `AttacksTriggeredEvent`; letting `move_to_zone` consult replacements for non-battlefield moves (new `SpellPutIntoGraveyardReplacementEvent`); restricted \"instant/sorcery-only\" mana in `ManaPool` with `spell=` payment kwarg; `card.mana_spent` stamping; `GameState.rng`; `Player.skip_turns` honored in turn rotation.\n\n**Notable spec-over-plan deviations:** sos_13's prepared copy is cast *paying* {W} (rule 722.3c — TODO suggested free), and is created in exile at prepare time, ceasing to exist when cast-and-resolved or when the permanent leaves; sos_120's \"exile this spell\" applies on every resolution, not just the first. All decisions and deliberate limitations (e.g. E2 covering only precombat mains, surveil keeping library order) are recorded in `KEY_DECISIONS.md`."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":783,"cache_read_input_tokens":288361,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":783},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2cbc3e54-8234-4118-a40c-c107afe702c2","uuid":"8cc12842-ce3a-44a4-b61b-e635ebc38946","request_id":"req_011CbwHtShJnqtCugXe1wE9c"}
